flowchart TD
    START[Admin logs in at /admin/login] --> CHECK{Is admin?}
    CHECK -->|No, first user| SETUP[Call setup-admin Edge Fn]
    SETUP --> DASH
    CHECK -->|Yes| DASH[Admin Dashboard]
    CHECK -->|No, admin exists| DENIED[Access Denied]

    DASH --> PROD[Manage Products]
    DASH --> TEAM[Manage Team]
    DASH --> CONT[Manage Site Content]
    DASH --> OFFER[Manage Garden Offers]
    DASH --> GALL[Manage Gallery]

    PROD --> |Add/Edit product in DE| TRANS[Translate Edge Fn]
    TEAM --> |Add/Edit member in DE| TRANS
    CONT --> |Add/Edit content in DE| TRANS
    OFFER --> |Add/Edit offer in DE| TRANS

    TRANS --> |Dictionary-based DE to EN| AUTO[Auto-fill English fields]
    AUTO --> SAVE[Save to Database via Supabase Client]

    PROD --> |Upload image| STORE[Upload to Storage Bucket]
    GALL --> |Upload image| STORE
    STORE --> SAVE

    SAVE --> PUBLIC[Visible on Public Pages]
